{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Club Soko",
    "steam_appid": 3346410,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/52839948e379316f091d5a2d34f394c5.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=89 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Club Soko is a sokoban style puzzle game where you play as a raver graffiti artist moving through an exclusive underground nightclub. As you venture deeper and deeper you discover sinister secrets in its depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/a34ad5f153b4b3188a7e47338723484e.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/a34ad5f153b4b3188a7e47338723484e.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/a34ad5f153b4b3188a7e47338723484e.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/2181c2640ddda3ea493cb2ee3fdcfdce.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the room and outsmart a wide cast of characters using what you have around you. Each puzzle is carefully crafted to teach you new, surprising and tricky ways of delving deeper and deeper into Club Soko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/b9f2fc9dc95ea7bb6600c88870042e65.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/b9f2fc9dc95ea7bb6600c88870042e65.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/b9f2fc9dc95ea7bb6600c88870042e65.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/1e6db487f6cd8c48cf7a84fb10eb670b.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=95 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Maude, a graffiti artist set on spray painting her tag on every available inch of the nightclub walls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/faba29ba040b5b16b904feee7081e484.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/faba29ba040b5b16b904feee7081e484.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/faba29ba040b5b16b904feee7081e484.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/6326b372b4805aff2dcee829c4d0e60c.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=85 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab your ticket at the doors of the venue and venture into the diverse weirdo underbelly of Club Soko exploring its thriving subcultures and extreme music genres.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/fc2a4d5736b098012a33a6a6f206ede4.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/fc2a4d5736b098012a33a6a6f206ede4.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/fc2a4d5736b098012a33a6a6f206ede4.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is its own Sokoban esque puzzle piece with its own <strong>predictable behaviors</strong>\u00a0on a grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through over <strong>100+\u00a0handcrafted levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>undo system</strong> to solve puzzles in your own time, work through ideas and undo your mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore dancefloors</strong>\u00a0each featuring their own distinct 2.5DHD visual style and musical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Sokoban Reimagined</strong> - It wouldn't be a Sokoban without boxes! Use objects such as <strong>speakers, amps, and even other dancers\u00a0</strong>when making your way past bouncers isn't quite enough to get to the next dancefloor!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/f3c0c94e40151e9b31539af8e9d6a2f0.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/ec38f3e225eb241e31c39037fcde4f19.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/ec38f3e225eb241e31c39037fcde4f19.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/ec38f3e225eb241e31c39037fcde4f19.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/52839948e379316f091d5a2d34f394c5.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=89 /></span><strong> </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Club Soko is a sokoban style puzzle game where you play as a raver graffiti artist moving through an exclusive underground nightclub. As you venture deeper and deeper you discover sinister secrets in its depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/a34ad5f153b4b3188a7e47338723484e.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/a34ad5f153b4b3188a7e47338723484e.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/a34ad5f153b4b3188a7e47338723484e.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/2181c2640ddda3ea493cb2ee3fdcfdce.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=94 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read the room and outsmart a wide cast of characters using what you have around you. Each puzzle is carefully crafted to teach you new, surprising and tricky ways of delving deeper and deeper into Club Soko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/b9f2fc9dc95ea7bb6600c88870042e65.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared