om/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/fc2a4d5736b098012a33a6a6f206ede4.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/fc2a4d5736b098012a33a6a6f206ede4.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/fc2a4d5736b098012a33a6a6f206ede4.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each character is its own Sokoban esque puzzle piece with its own <strong>predictable behaviors</strong>\u00a0on a grid.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate your way through over <strong>100+\u00a0handcrafted levels</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An <strong>undo system</strong> to solve puzzles in your own time, work through ideas and undo your mistakes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore dancefloors</strong>\u00a0each featuring their own distinct 2.5DHD visual style and musical themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Sokoban Reimagined</strong> - It wouldn't be a Sokoban without boxes! Use objects such as <strong>speakers, amps, and even other dancers\u00a0</strong>when making your way past bouncers isn't quite enough to get to the next dancefloor!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/f3c0c94e40151e9b31539af8e9d6a2f0.avif?t=1753941645\" data-has-big width=800 height=107 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/ec38f3e225eb241e31c39037fcde4f19.poster.avif?t=1753941645\" width=618 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/ec38f3e225eb241e31c39037fcde4f19.webm?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3346410/extras/ec38f3e225eb241e31c39037fcde4f19.mp4?t=1753941645\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
